+# The initramfs owns the D2S USB gadget for its entire lifetime. Samsung's
+# configfs implementation can panic when a function is unlinked and relinked,
+# so mask every userspace gadget owner and only configure the resulting usb0.
+for unit in usb-moded.service usb-rescue-mode-off.service usb-tethering.service; do
