+# Morph's QtWebEngine already contains UBports' HybrisMediaCodecVideoDecoder.
+# Do not inject the separate gst-hybris plugin: on this Halium 11 device its
+# plugin initialization blocks gst-plugin-scanner and leaves media-hub in a
